L06 -- MOMENT-DISCIPLINE ON THE RAR: the surviving bound technology vs the framework core
        identity: g_obs^2 = g_bar^2 + a0 g_bar,  a0 = 9.36190e-11 m/s^2 (committed footing)
        boots = 2000, seed = 20260923, kill bar = 5.0 SE (one-sided on M1, two-sided on M3)
====================================================================================================

--- (a) SPARC RING ENSEMBLE (REAL): rotation_curve_corpus_v7.json, survey=SPARC ---
  SPARC galaxies used: 175/175, rings kept: 3389
  3389 rings, log10 g_bar in [-12.68, -8.13]
  deep subset (g_bar < 0.2 a0): 1699 rings from 155 galaxies -- the power-optimal lane

--- (b) MIGHTEE-HI RAR (REAL): 80 rings, digitized, Varasteanu+2025 ---
  rings: 80   (G099-validated digitization, 0.036 dex rms)
  note: the digitized table carries no galaxy ids -- ring-level bootstrap only

--- (c) CLASH cluster RAR (REAL): tian2020 fig2, VizieR -- cross-check, not merged ---
  rings: 84 from 20 clusters

--- (d) SYNTHETIC TWIN (CONTROL ONLY -- NOT evidence): a0-line + 4% g_obs scatter
        + 15% misclassification (X_obs = X*10^eta, eta~N(0,0.2) on 15% of rings) ---
  800 rings, log10 X ~ U(-12.4,-9.3), 4% g_obs scatter, 114 misclassified

